---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<Base title="Careers | Global Enterprise" description="Join Global Enterprise and help design operating models, intelligence systems, and institutional capabilities that hold under pressure." image="/media/original/careers-apprentice.avif" keywords={["Global Enterprise careers", "future-facing consulting careers", "AI research careers", "strategy careers", "enterprise transformation careers"]}>
  <section class="bg-cobalt py-20 text-white md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow text-lime">Careers</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">Bring range, rigor, and a point of view.</h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/75">We are building a serious, interdisciplinary team for work that sits between frontier intelligence, institutional strategy, technology, and the reality of making change hold.</p></div><div><div class="border-t border-white/20 pt-6"><p class="font-display text-6xl font-medium tracking-[-0.08em] text-lime">01</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">One standard: make the work more useful than you found it.</p></div><figure class="mt-8 overflow-hidden border border-white/20 bg-ink"><AssetImage src="/media/original/careers-apprentice.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="An apprentice and an older craftsperson reviewing a wooden prototype at a worn workbench" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover opacity-90" /><figcaption class="border-t border-white/15 px-4 py-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/60">Capability grows when the standard can be handed to someone else.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Why here" title="High standards. Low theater." /><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>You will work with people who care about the quality of the thinking, the composure of the process, and the usefulness of the result. We make room for clear writing, honest questions, and disagreement that makes the work more exact.</p><p>Our engagements touch AI-native operations, data institutions, frontier research, resilient systems, human capability, and the change architecture that connects them.</p><p>We are interested in thoughtful operators, strategists, technologists, researchers, and leaders who want their work to travel beyond a slide deck and remain useful after the room has moved on.</p><a class="btn-dark mt-4" href="mailto:info@globalenterprise.com?subject=Working%20at%20Global%20Enterprise">Introduce yourself <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site"><SectionHeading eyebrow="How we work together" title="The team is part of the product." /><div class="mt-16 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Outcome</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Own the outcome</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Be clear about what better looks like, then stay close to the people who need to feel it.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Legibility</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Make it legible</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Good work should help the next person see what matters and what to do next.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Curiosity</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Stay curious</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">The world changes. We keep learning, testing, and updating our point of view.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="The work you might do" title="The work is varied. The standard is not." /><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Frame the system</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Turn a complex mandate into a point of view a leadership team can use.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Make the decision real</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Connect policy, architecture, data, and workflow to the operating consequence.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Write for action</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Make the analysis clear enough that the next person can make a better choice.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Leave capability behind</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Help the client improve the system after the engagement, not depend on us forever.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Base>
